      },
      "privateNotes": "<p><strong>@UUID[Compendium.points-of-interest.journals.JournalEntry.jxn9bB1XhZTRpF65.JournalEntryPage.wHeJAYszJH8N6zBw]{20. The Burning Giant}.</strong> Headwoman of Kettle Hollow, hiding thirty villagers in the grain cellar and well-house. NPC Core Mayor.</p>",
      "publicNotes": "<p>The mayor is the political leader of a settlement. While not always an elected position, it usually involves devoting time to both civic and ceremonial functions and knowing the needs of their settlement.</p><hr /><p>Larger societies rely on those with the authority and the ability to interpret and enforce laws. Some carry out these duties fairly, but others are harsh and cruel, imposing severe punishments on anyone unable to pay for clemency.</p>\n<h2>Appearance</h2>\n<p>A weathered woman in her sixties with soot-streaked grey hair tied back, a shepherd's crook in one hand, her other arm around a frightened child. Her expression is steady.</p>",
      "publication": {
        "license": "ORC",
        "remaster": true,
        "title": "Pathfinder NPC Core"
      }
